  "applied": "6-DoF 2D-3D registration (vs_mid360 fit B: livox_frame <- laser_frame, all stills) composed with base_link <- livox_frame (team decision). Leave-one-session-out: spins z 342.2 roll -1.20 pitch -1.01, str1 z 344.7 roll -1.53 pitch -0.81, str2 z 344.0 roll -1.45 pitch -0.85, poses z 341.7 roll -1.32 pitch -0.94; held-out residuals below the 4-DoF form in every session. z / roll are weakly constrained (only non-vertical surfaces) and couple to the Mid-360S tilt: the 2026-10-11 21:00 run gave z 351.2 mm, roll -0.87 deg for the same, unchanged G2 mount. Tape: z 338.6 mm.",
